        <div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">If an emerging growth company, indicate by check mark if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition period for complying with any new or revised
          financial accounting standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <ix:nonNumeric name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod" id="Fact_21cc162f803f400a8fb895739aec0a1c" contextRef="c20230101to20230930" format="ixt-sec:boolballotbox">&#x2610;</ix:nonNumeric></div>

