        <div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">As of <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.3333px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;">November 14, 2023,</span> the Registrant had <ix:nonFraction name="dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding" id="Fact_58532dc378f24bb49fcee425e3d0930a" contextRef="c20231114_StatementClassOfStockAxis_CommonClassAMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">6,443,098</ix:nonFraction> shares of its Class A common stock, $0.0001 par value per share, and <ix:nonFraction name="dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding" id="Fact_42478df7823a41f7b74cf688ebc0f008" contextRef="c20231114_StatementClassOfStockAxis_CommonClassBMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">6,900,000</ix:nonFraction>
          shares of its Class B common stock, $0.0001 par value per share, outstanding.</div>

