        <ix:continuation id="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f20" continuedAt="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f21">
<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;">Redemption of Warrants When the Price per Share of Class A Common Stock Equals
            or Exceeds $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" id="Fact_14ef81d668db402f8875074386353de6" contextRef="c20230930_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_WarrantsAndRightsSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionOneMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_CommonClassAMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">18.00</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"> - Once the warrants become exercisable, the Company may redeem
            the outstanding Public Warrants:</span></div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f21" continuedAt="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f22">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> </span><br />
        </div>
</ix:continuation>
