  <tr>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#8226;</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">at a price of $<ix:nonFraction name="paci:ClassOfWarrantOrRightRedemptionPriceOfWarrantsOrRights" id="Fact_9a67bd66a8954dfc9d32b9b95b3d3cc1" contextRef="c20230930_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_WarrantsAndRightsSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionOneMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_CommonClassAMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.01</ix:nonFraction> per Public Warrant;</div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f25" continuedAt="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f26">
<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> </span><br />
        </div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f26" continuedAt="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f27">
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;" class="DSPFListTable">


  <tr>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#8226;</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">upon a minimum of <ix:nonNumeric name="paci:NoticePeriodToRedeemWarrants" id="Fact_4f9e13312d11461f98656c11ff26013a" contextRef="c20230101to20230930_RangeAxis_MinimumMember_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_WarrantsAndRightsSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionOneMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_CommonClassAMember" format="ixt-sec:durday">30</ix:nonNumeric> days&#8217; prior written notice of redemption, or the <ix:nonNumeric name="paci:ClassOfWarrantOrRightRedemptionPeriod" id="Fact_86981dab46164ffb988b557e2edefa01" contextRef="c20230101to20230930_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_WarrantsAndRightsSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionOneMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_CommonClassAMember" format="ixt-sec:durday">30</ix:nonNumeric>-day redemption period to each warrant holder; and</div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f27" continuedAt="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f28">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
        </div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f28" continuedAt="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f29">
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;" class="DSPFListTable">


  <tr>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#8226;</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">if, and only if, the last reported sale price of the Class A common stock equals or exceeds $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" id="Fact_faaf4f8b025340fc8a64c0f6e1a942be" contextRef="c20230930_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_WarrantsAndRightsSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionOneMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_CommonClassAMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">18.00</ix:nonFraction>
                  per share (as adjusted for stock splits, stock dividends, reorganization, recapitalizations and the like) for any <ix:nonNumeric name="paci:ThresholdTradingDays" id="Fact_6b50b4031ab74e11a6ce098578ffdb77" contextRef="c20230101to20230930_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_WarrantsAndRightsSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionOneMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_CommonClassAMember" format="ixt-sec:durday">20</ix:nonNumeric> trading
                  days within a <ix:nonNumeric name="paci:ThresholdConsecutiveTradingDays" id="Fact_d38af8c37d124065b273ff46ae6d2536" contextRef="c20230101to20230930_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_WarrantsAndRightsSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionOneMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_CommonClassAMember" format="ixt-sec:durday">30</ix:nonNumeric>-trading day period ending on the third trading day prior to the date on which the Company sends the notice of
                  redemption to warrant holders.</div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f29" continuedAt="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f30">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
        </div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f30" continuedAt="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f31">
<div style="text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;">Redemption of Warrants When the Price per Class A Common
            Stock Equals or Exceeds $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" id="Fact_fa070484db464cf880fcdc3f0e6ef9f8" contextRef="c20230930_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_WarrantsAndRightsSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionTwoMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_CommonClassAMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">10.00</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"> - Once the warrants become exercisable, the
            Company may redeem the outstanding warrants:</span></div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f31" continuedAt="Text_ac82a32386e6406fb834de043af2006f32">
